{"type":"text","timestamp":1789782349620,"sessionID":"ses_f48aaa6a5ffe5n0V4QRqmAEfOf","part":{"id":"prt_0b7574026001c4letxxIf3NjVy","messageID":"msg_0b75739ce001tA3rKJnhBjGtBD","sessionID":"ses_f48aaa6a5ffe5n0V4QRqmAEfOf","type":"text","text":"Implemented the organization-isolation fixes.\n\n### Changes\n- **`src/services/project-service.ts`**: Project reads and updates now require membership in the project’s owning organization. Successful updates invalidate every cached list variant for that organization while preserving unrelated organizations’ caches.\n- **`src/cache/keys.ts`**: List cache keys now include an unambiguous organization prefix and retain all pagination and sorting parameters.\n- **`tests/project-isolation.test.ts`**: Added regression coverage for unauthorized access, organization switching, cache reuse, all list variants, targeted invalidation, and revoked membership.\n\nList authorization remains checked before cache access. Caching stays enabled, and existing API signatures, response shapes, and status-code conventions are preserved.\n\n### Verification\n- `npm test`: **13 tests passed**, including all 8 existing tests and 5 new regression tests.\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\n- Existing tests were not modified; no dependencies were installed.","time":{"start":1789782343718,"end":1789782349619},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_05419c810dda10d3016aade947a1f087d1b925c10d44145592","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
